Reason:
The removal of the handling for the `FL_NOIRQ` board flag during the IRQ allocation process led to the assumption that all devices would require an IRQ. This caused the code to allocate IRQ vectors and set the IRQ for devices that should not have one, resulting in incorrect behavior for boards with the `FL_NOIRQ` flag.

The code statements that fix the bug are:
```c
if (board->flags & FL_NOIRQ) {
